1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,520
Part sixteen. Service and AMC.

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:10,360
When a customer calls with a problem, open Service and add a ticket: the issue,

3
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:15,441
the customer, the type such as breakdown or cleaning, the priority,

4
00:00:15,441 --> 00:00:18,626
the technician and the date to resolve by.

5
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:24,949
WhatsApp tells the customer their request is registered, with the ticket number.

6
00:00:24,949 --> 00:00:27,794
Urgent and overdue tickets show in alerts.

7
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:34,257
When it is fixed, edit the ticket, write what was done and set it to Resolved,

8
00:00:34,257 --> 00:00:35,113
then Closed.

9
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:44,377
Annual maintenance contracts are under AMC: the customer, start and end dates,

10
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:47,420
visits per year and the contract value.

11
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:51,790
Thirty days before the end, a renewal alert reminds you,

12
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:54,989
and WhatsApp has a renewal message ready.

13
00:00:56,140 --> 00:01:00,152
Next video: Expenses, documents and your team.

